UnwrapModule
├── constructor
│   ├── when wrappedNative is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert with UnwrapModule_ZeroWrappedNative
│   ├── when wrappedNative has no code
│   │   └── it should revert with UnwrapModule_WrappedNativeNotContract
│   └── when wrappedNative is a contract
│       └── it should set wrappedNative
├── receive
│   ├── when value comes from the wrapper
│   │   └── it should accept the value
│   └── when value comes from anyone else
│       └── it should revert with UnwrapModule_UnexpectedNativeSender
├── execute
│   ├── when token is not wrappedNative
│   │   └── it should return failed result with "Only wrapped native supported"
│   ├── when amount is zero
│   │   └── it should return failed result with "Zero amount"
│   ├── when caller has insufficient balance
│   │   └── it should return failed result with "Insufficient balance"
│   ├── when caller has not approved the module
│   │   └── it should return failed result with "Transfer failed"
│   ├── when caller cannot take native value
│   │   ├── it should return failed result with "Native transfer failed"
│   │   ├── it should return the wrapped balance to the caller
│   │   └── it should hold nothing afterwards
│   ├── when all checks pass
│   │   ├── it should burn the wrapped balance from the caller
│   │   ├── it should send the native value to the caller
│   │   ├── it should return success with the native sentinel as outputToken
│   │   ├── it should hold nothing afterwards
│   │   └── it should emit Unwrapped
│   └── fuzz
│       └── when any non-zero amount is unwrapped
│           └── it should deliver exactly that amount
├── validate
│   ├── when token is not wrappedNative
│   │   └── it should return false with "Only wrapped native supported"
│   ├── when amount is zero
│   │   └── it should return false with "Zero amount"
│   ├── when caller has insufficient balance
│   │   └── it should return false with "Insufficient balance"
│   └── when all checks pass
│       └── it should return true with empty reason
├── estimateOutput
│   └── it should return amount and the native sentinel
└── moduleType
    └── it should return "UNWRAP"
